<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GRINAKER GROUP SAYS IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>GRINAKER GROUP SAYS IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q Data Ltd , Grinaker Holdings Ltd, Grintek Ltd and Siltek Ltd said on Wednesday that talks were in progress which if successfully concluded could have an effect on their share prices.</p>
<p>Shareholders were accordingly advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>No further details were announced in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
